challenge: >-
  Replies from LinkedIn campaigns, the web intake form and emails all landed in one place. Someone had to read each one, decide whether it was a real buyer, a returning client or noise, and copy it into JobTread. Good leads waited, and every person sorted them a little differently.
solution: >-
  The SalnetHub team first built AI lead qualification in Zapier for LinkedIn replies. The client came back for a second build: a RAG system in n8n: an AI knowledge base chatbot built from Google Drive, OpenAI embeddings and Pinecone, and an AI agent that scores and routes every enquiry, with leads sent to JobTread through Zapier.
